      "num_turns": 19,
      "result": "Implemented the Laravel 11 URL shortener with MySQL-backed links and click counts. The API supports creating and listing links, looking them up, and redirecting with one click recorded per request. `start.sh` applies migrations and serves on `0.0.0.0:8000` without loading a scaffolded `.env`; the README explains how to start it.\n\nVerified the routes and migrations, and exercised create, duplicate, invalid and malformed requests, generated codes, lookup, redirect, click counting, and unknown-code handling over HTTP. `php artisan test` passes, though Laravel reports a warning for the scaffolded feature test. The API server started during verification is still running.",
